[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So we need to **add a negative term** to make $ p > 0 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Try:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{12 + \sqrt{66}}{3} = \frac{12 + \sqrt{66} - 0}{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Try $ p = 1 $, and see if we can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{12 + \sqrt{66}}{3} = \frac{12 + \sqrt{66} - 1}{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{11 + \sqrt{66}}{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ m = 11 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ n = 66 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ p = 1 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ q = 3 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m This is now in the required form.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m x_1 + x_{11} = \frac{11 + \sqrt{66}}{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Thus:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \boxed{m + n + p + q = 11 + 66 + 1 + 3 = \boxed{81}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### **Final Answer:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
