[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 1: Express time in hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s convert all times to hours:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - 4 hours = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - 2 hours and 24 minutes = $ 2 + \frac{24}{60} = 2.4 $ hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 2: Use the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
