[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 3: First scenario: $ s $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m She walks 9 km at speed $ s $ km/h, and the total time is 4 hours (including $ t $ minutes).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
