[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 4: Use the condition $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s consider the vector approach.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ \vec{IA} = \vec{A} - \vec{I} $,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ \vec{OI} = \vec{I} - \vec{O} $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
