[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Where $ A $ is the area, $ s = \frac{a + b + c}{2} $ is the semi-perimeter.
