[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### **Step 1: Define variables**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ s $ = Aya's walking speed in km/h
