[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - When she walks at speed $ s $, the walk takes 4 hours = 240 minutes, including $ t $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - When she walks at speed $ s + 2 $, the walk takes 2 hours 24 minutes = 144 minutes, including $ t $ minutes
