[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### Case 1: Speed = $ s $, time = 240 minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = s \times \frac{240}{60} = s \times 4 \Rightarrow s = \frac{9}{4} = 2.25 \text{ km/h}
