[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 0 = \frac{T}{60} \cdot (s + 2 - s) = \frac{T}{60} \cdot 2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{T}{60} \cdot 2 = 0 \Rightarrow T = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m That can’t be right. So we need to **re-express the total time** properly.
