[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### **Step 6: Re-express the total time correctly**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s define:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ T $ = total time in minutes (including $ t $)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ t $ = time in minutes spent in the coffee shop
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - So the walking time is $ T - t $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### Case 1: Speed = $ s $, walking time = $ T - t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = s \cdot \frac{T - t}{60}
