[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### Case 2: Speed = $ s + 2 $, walking time = $ T - t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = (s + 2) \cdot \frac{T - t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now we have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = s \cdot \frac{T - t}{60} \tag{1}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = (s + 2) \cdot \frac{T - t}{60} \tag{2}
