[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Subtract (1) from (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 0 = (s + 2 - s) \cdot \frac{T - t}{60}
