[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So total time $ T = t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now substitute into (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = s \cdot \frac{T}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \Rightarrow s = \frac{9 \cdot 60}{T}
