[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Similarly, $ a_5 = a_2 $, $ a_6 = a_2 $, $ a_7 = a_2 $, $ a_8 = a_2 $, $ a_9 = a_2 $, $ a_{10} = a_2 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So the sequence is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m a_2, \frac{26}{5a_2}, a_2, a_2, a_2, a_2, a_2, a_2, a_2, a_2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now compute the sum:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m a_2 + \frac{26}{5a_2} + a_2 + a_2 + a_2 + a_2 + a_2 + a_2 + a_2 + a_2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m = 2a_2 + \frac{26}{5a_2} + 8a_2 = 10a_2 + \frac{26}{5a_2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are told the total sum is 20:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 10a_2 + \frac{26}{5a_2} = 20
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Multiply both sides by $ 5a_2 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 50a_2^2 + 26 = 100a_2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 50a_2^2 - 100a_2 + 26 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Solve this quadratic:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m a_2 = \frac{100 \pm \sqrt{100^2 - 4 \cdot 50 \cdot 26}}{2 \cdot 50}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m = \frac{100 \pm \sqrt{10000 - 5200}}{100}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m = \frac{100 \pm \sqrt{4800}}{100}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \sqrt{4800} = \sqrt{16 \cdot 300} = 4\sqrt{300} = 4\sqrt{100 \cdot 3} = 4 \cdot 10 \sqrt{3} = 40\sqrt{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m a_2 = \frac{100 \pm 40\sqrt{3}}{100} = \frac{10 \pm 4\sqrt{3}}{10}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now we want to find $ a_2 + a_{11} = 2a_2 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 2a_2 = 2 \cdot \frac{10 \pm 4\sqrt{3}}{10} = \frac{10 \pm 4\sqrt{3}}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m A_1 A_2 + A_1 A_{11} = \frac{10 + 4\sqrt{3}}{5} = \frac{10\sqrt{3} + 4}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m But we need to write this in the form $ \frac{m\sqrt{n} - p}{q} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{10 + 4\sqrt{3}}{5} = \frac{10\sqrt{3} + 4}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We can write this as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{10\sqrt{3} - (-4)}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m A_1 A_2 + A_1 A_{11} = \frac{10\sqrt{3} - (-4)}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So $ m = 10, n = 3, p = 4, q = 5 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
