[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m > "Find the greatest real number that is less than $BD^2$ for all such rhombi."
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So we are to find the **infimum** of $BD^2$ over all such rhombi, i.e., the **minimum possible value** of $BD^2$, and then the **greatest real number less than that**.
