[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 4: Minimize $c^2 + d^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are to minimize $c^2 + d^2$ under the constraint:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
