[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m c^2 + d^2 = 20 \left(1 + \frac{d^2}{24} \right) + d^2 = 20 + \frac{20d^2}{24} + d^2 = 20 + \frac{d^2}{1.2} + d^2
