[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{0^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow \frac{a^2}{20} = 1 \Rightarrow a^2 = 20 \Rightarrow a = \sqrt{20}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - For point $B = (0, b)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{0^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow -\frac{b^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow b^2 = -24
