[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 1: Use the condition $\overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m This is a key geometric condition. It tells us that the line segment $IA$ is perpendicular to the line segment $OI$. This is a special property that occurs in certain types of triangles, particularly in triangles where the incenter and circumcenter are aligned in a specific way.
