[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 5: Use formula for $AB \cdot AC$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m In triangle $ABC$, the product $AB \cdot AC$ can be related to the circumradius and other triangle quantities.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We use the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
