[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ k = 7 $: $ b = \frac{7(7 - 1)}{9 - 7} = \frac{42}{2} = 21 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ k = 8 $: $ b = \frac{7(8 - 1)}{9 - 8} = \frac{49}{1} = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So $ b = 21 $ and $ b = 49 $ are possible.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### Case 2: $ 9 - k < 0 \Rightarrow k > 9 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{7(k - 1)}{9 - k} > 9
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \Rightarrow 7(k - 1) < 9(9 - k)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \Rightarrow 7k - 7 < 81 - 9k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \Rightarrow 16k < 88
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \Rightarrow k < 5.5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m But $ k > 9 $ and $ k < 5.5 $ is impossible.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So no solutions in this case.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
