[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Substitute $ s \approx 3.85 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
