[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 3: Compute $BD^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are to compute $BD^2$, where $B = (c, d)$ and $D = (-c, -d)$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m BD^2 = (-c - c)^2 + (-d - d)^2 = (-2c)^2 + (-2d)^2 = 4c^2 + 4d^2 = 4(c^2 + d^2)
