[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m BD^2 = 4(c^2 + d^2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are to **maximize** the **greatest real number less than $BD^2$** for all such rhombi.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
