[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Substitute into $BD^2 = 4(c^2 + d^2)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
