[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m r = \frac{\Delta}{s}, \quad R = \frac{abc}{4\Delta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
