[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now, we are told that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
