[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ R = 13 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ r = 6 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m In a right-angled triangle, the circumradius is half the hypotenuse:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m R = \frac{a}{2} \Rightarrow a = 2R = 26
