[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 1: Convert all times to hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - 4 hours = 4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - 2 hours and 24 minutes = 2 + 24/60 = 2.4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s denote the time it takes her to walk 9 km at speed $ s $ as $ T $, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m T = 4 \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m But this is the total time, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So, the actual time she spends walking is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \text{Walking time} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m She walks 9 km at speed $ s $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \text{Walking time} = \frac{9}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 2: Use the second scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m She walks at speed $ s + 2 $ km/h, and the total time is 2 hours and 24 minutes = 2.4 hours.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
