[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 2. $ \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s solve these equations.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 3: Solve for $ t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m From equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Multiply both sides by $ s $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = 4s - \frac{ts}{60} \quad \text{(3)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m From equation (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Multiply both sides by $ s + 2 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 = 2.4(s + 2) - \frac{t(s + 2)}{60} \quad \text{(4)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now we have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - (3): $ 9 = 4s - \frac{ts}{60} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - (4): $ 9 = 2.4(s + 2) - \frac{t(s + 2)}{60} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s subtract (3) from (4):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 - 9 = 2.4(s + 2) - \frac{t(s + 2)}{60} - \left(4s - \frac{ts}{60}\right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Simplify the right-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 0 = 2.4s + 4.8 - \frac{t(s + 2)}{60} - 4s + \frac{ts}{60}
