[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $A = (a, b)$: $\frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $B = (c, d)$: $\frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{d^2}{24} = 1$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $C = (-a, -b)$: $\frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1$ (same as A)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $D = (-c, -d)$: $\frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{d^2}{24} = 1$ (same as B)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
