[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 1: Interpret the numbers in base $ b $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_{b} $ represents:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Similarly, the number $ 97_{b} $ represents:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9 \cdot b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are told that $ 17_{b} $ divides $ 97_{b} $, i.e.,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 2: Use the divisibility condition
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s write this as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We can rewrite the left-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9b + 7 = 9(b + 7) - 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 9(b + 7) - 56 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m This implies:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m -56 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m b + 7 \mid 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 3: Find all $ b > 9 $ such that $ b + 7 \mid 56 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We need to find all divisors of 56 that are greater than $ 9 - 7 = 2 $, and then subtract 7 to get $ b $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s list the positive divisors of 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 1, 2, 4, 7, 8, 14, 28, 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now, we want $ b + 7 $ to be one of these divisors, and $ b > 9 $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m b + 7 \in \{8, 14, 28, 56\}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - If $ b + 7 = 8 $, then $ b = 1 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - If $ b + 7 = 14 $, then $ b = 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - If $ b + 7 = 28 $, then $ b = 21 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - If $ b + 7 = 56 $, then $ b = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m But we are only interested in $ b > 9 $, so we exclude $ b = 1 $ and $ b = 7 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So the valid values of $ b $ are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
