[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Set (3) equal to (4):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 240 - \frac{540}{s} = 144 - \frac{540}{s + 2}
