[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the Geometry of the Rhombus
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m A **rhombus** has:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - All sides equal in length.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - Diagonals intersect at the **origin** (the center of the hyperbola).
