[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Then the diagonals are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $AC: \text{from } (a, b) \text{ to } (-a, -b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $BD: \text{from } (c, d) \text{ to } (-c, -d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Since the diagonals intersect at the origin, and the rhombus is symmetric about the origin, this is a valid configuration.
