[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - For $A = (a, b)$: $\frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - For $B = (c, d)$: $\frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{d^2}{24} = 1$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
