[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m The dot product of the diagonals is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m (-2a)(-2c) + (-2b)(-2d) = 4ac + 4bd
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Since the diagonals are perpendicular, the dot product must be zero:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
