[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 4: Use the Rhombus Side Length
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m In a rhombus, all sides are equal. So the distance between $A$ and $B$ must equal the distance between $A$ and $C$, etc.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s compute the distance between $A = (a, b)$ and $B = (c, d)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
