[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Since $AB = AC$ in a rhombus:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m (c - a)^2 + (d - b)^2 = 4a^2 + 4b^2
