[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 5: Use Symmetry and Parametrize the Points
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s parametrize the points on the hyperbola.
