[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ 97_{b} = 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We are told that $ 17_{b} $ divides $ 97_{b} $, i.e.,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} \text{ is an integer}
