[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 3: Find all divisors of 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We find all positive divisors of 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
