[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So, $ b + 7 \in \{14, 28, 56\} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now solve for $ b $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ b + 7 = 14 \Rightarrow b = 7 $ → Not valid (since $ b > 9 $)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ b + 7 = 28 \Rightarrow b = 21 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - $ b + 7 = 56 \Rightarrow b = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So the valid bases are $ b = 21 $ and $ b = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
