[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - When she walks at **s + 2 km/h**, the total time is **2 hours and 24 minutes**, including the same **t minutes** at the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - We are to find the **time taken when she walks at s + 1/2 km/h**, including the **t minutes** at the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations based on the given information
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### First scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - Speed: $ s $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - Distance: 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - Time: 4 hours, including $ t $ minutes at the coffee shop
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Convert 4 hours to minutes: $ 4 \times 60 = 240 $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So, the time spent walking is $ 240 - t $ minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Time spent walking = $ \frac{9}{s} $ hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Convert that to minutes: $ \frac{9}{s} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s} $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{540}{s} = 240 - t
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### Second scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - Speed: $ s + 2 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m - Time: 2 hours and 24 minutes = $ 2 \times 60 + 24 = 124 $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So, the time spent walking is $ 124 - t $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Time spent walking = $ \frac{9}{s + 2} $ hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Convert to minutes: $ \frac{9}{s + 2} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s + 2} $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{540}{s + 2} = 124 - t
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 2: Solve the two equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We now have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 1. $ \frac{540}{s} = 240 - t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 2. $ \frac{540}{s + 2} = 124 - t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s solve these equations.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### From equation 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m t = 240 - \frac{540}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m #### From equation 2:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m t = 124 - \frac{540}{s + 2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Set the two expressions for $ t $ equal to each other:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 240 - \frac{540}{s} = 124 - \frac{540}{s + 2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 240 - 124 = \frac{540}{s} - \frac{540}{s + 2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 116 = 540 \left( \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} \right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Find the difference of the fractions:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} = \frac{(s + 2) - s}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{2}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 116 = 540 \cdot \frac{2}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 116 = \frac{1080}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now solve for $ s $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m s(s + 2) = \frac{1080}{116}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Simplify the right-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m s(s + 2) = \frac{270}{29}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Now solve the quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m s^2 + 2s - \frac{270}{29} = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Multiply through by 29 to eliminate the fraction:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 29s^2 + 58s - 270 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Use the quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m s = \frac{-58 \pm \sqrt{58^2 - 4 \cdot 29 \cdot (-270)}}{2 \cdot 29}
