[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m As before:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} = \frac{2}{s(s + 2)}
