[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 7: Use Symmetry and Optimization
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m Let’s assume that the rhombus is symmetric with respect to the origin, and that the diagonals are along the axes.
