[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m ### Step 3: Recheck the equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m We had:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13660)[0m $$
